    <string name="backfill_section">Previews</string>
    <string name="backfill_title">Prepare previews for existing files</string>
    <string name="backfill_desc">Files uploaded from now on get their previews and APK icons automatically. This optional step does the same for files you uploaded earlier, so they also show instantly on every device.</string>
    <string name="backfill_button">Prepare previews…</string>
    <string name="backfill_dialog_title">Allow DriveMount to prepare previews?</string>
    <string name="backfill_dialog_body">If you allow this, DriveMount will go through the account you choose and, on Wi-Fi only:

• download APK files (up to 300 MB each) and small images to read their icon or preview, and take a frame from videos without downloading them (about 1.5 GB at most per run)
• save the tiny previews on this phone, and in a hidden “.dmmeta” folder inside each cloud folder so other devices can use them (inside an encrypted vault they are encrypted too)

It uses some battery and data allowance, runs only while this is allowed, and you can stop it at any time. Nothing starts unless you tap Start.</string>
